// Noctalia custom Telegram theme - contrast-fixed variant.
// Based on the community "Telegram" template, with fixed text-selection
// contrast and no hard-coded colors: every pair below uses same-family
// Material You roles, so it stays readable in dark AND light mode.
//
// Fixed vs the community template:
//  1. Incoming bubbles had no msgInBg (merged with chat background) and no
//     msgInBgSelected - Telegram fell back to a light-blue default, so
//     selected text was light-on-light (~1.07:1). Selection is now solid
//     primary + on_primary (~10:1).
//  2. Removed hard-coded #313244 tint, red primary_container hover flash,
//     and primary-on-teal pairs (~2.5:1).
//  3. Outgoing bubble: muted tertiary_container + on_tertiary_container (11.4:1);
//     active chat row -> primary + on_primary.

